// Verified-free route allowlist for the cstack preset cost policy.
//
// This file is the EVIDENCE RECORD for rules/cost-and-models.md rule 2: an
// API key or a catalog listing is never permission to spend. A model route
// may run in an automatic chain only when it is listed here WITH evidence
// recorded at verification time. The checker (check_presets.py) fails closed:
// any model id that is neither a FILL_IN_* placeholder nor admitted here
// fails the run.
//
// Entry schema (every field required, no exceptions):
//   {
//     "id": "provider/model",          // exact model id used in the preset
//     "evidence": {
//       "source": "https://...",       // page where $0 pricing was verified
//       "checked": "YYYY-MM-DD",        // date of that verification
//       "quote": "..."                  // text quoted from the page proving
//                                      // the route is free
//     }
//   }
//
// NAMING IS NOT EVIDENCE. OpenRouter marks some routes with a ':free'
// suffix and NVIDIA has no universal free naming convention, so no slug
// pattern is ever inferred as free. Verify the pricing page itself, quote it,
// and date it. Grok/xAI entries are rejected outright (rule 3).
//
// Adding or changing an entry is a reviewed PR: cite the pricing page in the
// evidence and re-verify entries when providers change their catalogs. This
// copy ships EMPTY because no route has been verified yet; consumer
// projects keep their own copy (presets/README.md).
{
  "routes": []
}
